<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Elektra cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Elektra cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Fleming Inc said on Monday it had cut its rating for Mexico's Grupo Elektra SA de CV to speculative buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Elektra serves the mass of Mexico's population and dominates niches with relatively little competition, analyst Marc de Speville said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock was off 1/8 to 15-7/8 in New York.</p>
<p>-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879</p>
</text>
